<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- The menus: Y on a game (the game menu), on a grid or system (view options), on an app; the Confirm popup, X search,
     the on-screen keyboard, hold-to-confirm and Undo (Overlays.kt, ActionMenu.kt, AppActionMenu.kt, HoldConfirm.kt,
     TextEntry.kt). Keys start with menus_, then the menu. See docs/TRANSLATING.md. Menu rows sit on one line in a
     narrow card: keep labels and values as short as the English. -->
